  "details": "Would it be possible to make it so that disconnecting doesn't instantly teleport you back to the HUB?\nSay, you disconnected due to network partial outage for a few seconds, but you're already being teleported to the HUB. In my case it was annoying cause I had a moment with quite some amount of DCs and I had to reload into the world we were in many times and it's kinda annoying when the world takes longer to load.\nIt could also be useful for those who are in full servers and want to stay there.\n^ With that, I think you could make like a reserved spot if a disconnect is recognized. Not a quit, but a disconnect\nA reserved spot for a minute, for example. If you reconnect in that one minute, you're back to where you were.\nYou could also replace the person's avatar with smth like a unique \"Disconnected\" avatar while \"the spot is reserved\" and the person is trying to reconnect.",
